BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 653.77 Tm (The most expensive failure mode is trusting a single marketplace host. GPU Battle rented 291 Vast pods and 47 never) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 638.55 Tm (ran a single test, a 16% dud rate against 14 out of 200, about 7%, on RunPod; the duds were cheap, costing a dollar) Tj ET
