BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 177.62 Tm (Action: Commit only the capacity you will keep busier than the break-even line.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 162.40 Tm (Detail: Commit only when utilization will exceed 1 minus the discount; a $4.50 commit on $10 on-demand costs $5 per) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 147.17 Tm (used hour at 90% busy and $45 at 10% busy, so never commit to your peak [The Code Notebook - IZtzUfhm8LU @) Tj ET
