BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 374.32 Tm (work rather than sticker hours.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 359.10 Tm (Items: Run your own end-to-end workload in a roughly week-long POC before signing, and use multicloud optionality) Tj ET
