BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 192.85 Tm (cold: a $25,000 H100 plus $5,000 opex, a four-year life, and $2.30 per hour yielding roughly $55 a day, about $20,000) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 177.62 Tm (a year and $80,000 over the card's life, a 28% CAGR only at 100% utilization [9u2hCf8FlW0 @ 00:00:50]. Drop to) Tj ET
