BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 131.95 Tm (of neoclouds runs two to three times cheaper but is less reliable, and neoclouds can land 30 to 50% cheaper depending) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 116.72 Tm (on how long a contract you sign [_oWJ0t-RW7o @ 00:06:30]. Cloud Computing Insider frames the same gap) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 101.50 Tm (structurally, arguing hyperscalers charge more for AI because they were built for all IT and are less efficient at it) Tj ET
