BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 374.05 Tm (takes to pay off. Neural AI Flair reports radix cache hit rates of 60 to 90%, and a shared-token rule: below 20% shared) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 358.82 Tm (tokens the engines are equal, above 40% SGLang wins, and "Above 70%, expect two times or more throughput on the) Tj ET
