BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 206.57 Tm (BF16 to 27 GB in FP8 to 14 GB at 4-bit, lifting single-stream throughput from about 60 to 120 to roughly 240 tok/s,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 191.35 Tm (notes Marlin W4A16 delivers around 4 times up to batch 16 to 32, and points out that an FP8 KV cache halves) Tj ET
