BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (speaking at Data Science Festival, says to stay third-party under GBP 10k a month, to treat anything over GBP 100k as) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (a strong push to self-host, and to call everything in between 'it depends' [WiA5Hm6IpZs @ 00:13:30]. Daniel stacks) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (the costs plainly. GPUs run GBP 1-10k a month, and an ML engineer at GBP 800 a day is about GBP 16k a month.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (Daniel also warns that third-party prices may be VC-subsidized. Jono Finds puts the managed-gateway ceiling at 20k a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (month, which lands inside that band, and sends regulated, air-gapped or high-spend shops to self-hosting) Tj ET
